-0.3px] | [Hex] |\n| [e.g., Body text] | [Font] | [Size] | [Weight] | [Line height] | [Spacing] | [Hex] |\n| [e.g., Caption] | [Font] | [Size] | [Weight] | [Line height] | [Spacing] | [Hex] |\n\nText truncation rules:\n| Element | Max lines | Truncation | Behaviour |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| [Element] | [N] | Ellipsis end | [e.g., Tooltip on hover showing full text] |\n\n---\n\n4. COLOUR:\n| Element | State | Fill Colour | Opacity | Stroke Colour |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| [e.g., Primary button] | Default | #[Hex] | 100% | None |\n| [e.g., Primary button] | Hover | #[Hex] | 100% | None |\n| [e.g., Primary button] | Pressed | #[Hex] | 100% | None |\n| [e.g., Primary button] | Disabled | #[Hex] | 40% | None |\n| [e.g., Background] | — | #[Hex] | 100% | — |\n| [e.g., Divider] | — | #[Hex] | 20% | — |\n\nDark mode values:\n| Element | Light mode | Dark mode |\n|---|---|---|\n| [Element] | #[Hex] | #[Hex] |\n\n---\n\n5. STATES:\n| State | Trigger | Visual Change | Duration |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Default | On load | [Description] | — |\n| Hover | Mouse over (Web only) | [e.g., Background: #Hex, cursor: pointer] | 150ms |\n| Pressed / Active | Tap or click | [e.g., Background: #Hex, scale: 0.97] | 100ms |\n| Focused | Keyboard focus | [e.g., 2px solid #Hex outline, offset 2px] | — |\n| Disabled | Prop: disabled=true | [e.g., Opacity 40%, cursor: not-allowed] | — |\n| Loading | Async action triggered | [e.g., Spinner replaces label] | — |\n| Error | Validation failure | [e.g., Border: #ErrorHex, error message below] | — |\n| Empty | No data | [e.g., Empty state illustration + copy] | — |\n| Success | Action completed | [e.g., Checkmark animation + success message] | 300ms |\n\n---\n\n6. INTERACTION AND ANIMATION:\n| Interaction | Trigger | Animation | Duration | Easing |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| [e.g., Modal open] | Button tap | Fade in + slide up | 300ms | ease-out |\n| [e.g., Page transition] | Navigation | Slide left | 250ms | ease-in-out |\n| [e.g., Button press] | Tap 