ason | Estimated Improvement | Risk |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| [Table] | CREATE INDEX CONCURRENTLY [name] ON [table] ([columns]); | [Why needed] | [e.g., Seq scan -> Index scan — 20x faster] | Low |\n\nIndexes to drop:\n| Table | Index Name | Reason | Space Recovered | Risk |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| [Table] | [idx_name] | [e.g., Zero usage in past 90 days] | [e.g., 800MB] | Low |\n\n---\n\n4. PARTITIONING OPTIMIZATION:\nCurrent state: [e.g., No partitioning | Partitioned by month | Partitioned by region]\nProblem: [e.g., Queries scan all partitions — no partition pruning occurring]\n\nRecommendations:\n| Table | Current | Recommended | Reason | Expected Improvement |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| [Table] | No partitioning | Range by created_at — monthly | [e.g., 90% of queries filter by date] | [e.g., 95% partition pruning] |\n| [Table] | Yearly partitions | Monthly partitions | [e.g., Yearly too coarse — queries still scan full year] | [e.g., 12x more selective pruning] |\n\nPartition pruning verification:\n  - Check: EXPLAIN shows Partitions: [specific partitions] — not ALL\n  - If pruning not working: [e.g., Ensure query filter uses partition key directly — no function wrap]\n\nMigration approach: [How to repartition without downtime]\n\n---\n\n5. STORAGE OPTIMIZATION:\nCurrent storage breakdown:\n| Table | Raw Size | Index Size | Toast Size | Bloat | Total |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| [Table] | [Size] | [Size] | [Size] | [e.g., 40%] | [Total] |\n\nRecommendations:\n| Optimization | Table / Object | Action | Space Saved | Effort |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Compression | [Table] | [e.g., Enable ZSTD compression | Switch to columnar] | [e.g., ~60% reduction] | Low |\n| Bloat removal | [Table] | VACUUM FULL [table] (maintenance window) | [e.g., 800MB] | Low |\n| Archival | [Table] | [e.g., Move rows older than 2 years to cold storage] | [e.g., 1.2TB] | Medium |\n| Column pruning | [Table] | [e.g., Drop unused columns: col_a, col_b] | [e.g., 200GB] | Low |\n| Dedup