 Effort | Risk | Score | Priority | Rationale |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | [Feature Name] | High/Med/Low | High/Med/Low | High/Med/Low | [Score] | Must Have / Should Have / Nice to Have | [One line rationale] |\n\nDEPRIORITISED ITEMS:\n| Feature | Reason | Recommended Action |\n|---|---|---|\n| [Feature] | [Why deprioritised] | [Defer to next sprint / backlog / cancel] |\n\nOPEN DECISIONS:\n| Decision | Why It Blocks Prioritisation | Owner | Deadline |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| [Decision needed] | [Impact on priority order] | [Role] | [DD/MM/YYYY] |\n\nSUMMARY:\nTotal Features Assessed: [N]\nMust Have: [N] | Should Have: [N] | Nice to Have: [N]\nDeprioritised: [N]\nNeeds Clarification: [N] — IDs: [list]\nApproval Needed: [N] — IDs: [list]
